 r←GetDeprecatedBand comment;text
⍝ Returns the band that tells a visitor that a package is deprecated, as a vector of character
⍝ vectors, together with the comment given when it was deprecated, if any.
⍝ A URL in that comment becomes a link: it typically points to the successor. A full stop or a
⍝ comma right after the URL is taken to end the sentence rather than to belong to the URL.
 r←⊂'<div class="deprecated-band">'
 r,←⊂'<p class="deprecated-label">Deprecated</p>'
 :If 0<≢comment
     text←'(https?://[^\s<>"]*[^\s<>".,;:)])'⎕R'<a href="\1">\1</a>'⊣EscapeSpecialChars comment
     r,←⊂'<p>',text,'</p>'
 :EndIf
 r,←⊂'</div>'
⍝Done
